WEBVTT

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.910
OPEN FORUM BY THE STUDENT COUNCIL AND
A VOLUNTEER COALITION REGARDING THE
ELIMINATION OF DISCRIMINATION IN THE SCHOOL

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.990
APRIL 23, 2095

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:21.290
Just as you pointed out, I won't deny
that discrimination does exist at this school.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.630
Despite efforts by the school,

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.500
the Student Council and the
Disciplinary Committee to ban them,

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.470
the terms so many students
continue to use...

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.340
The open forum must've started by now, huh?

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.510
If it's bothering you, should we go?

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:37.640
No. I'm sure both sides
have something to say,

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.640
but I don't want to see them arguing.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.020
Honoka...

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.270
After all, we're--

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.230
What's going on?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.440
What just happened?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.610
Don't let them get away!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.610
Honoka!

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.490
M-My legs!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.790
Honoka, Shizuku! Are you all right?

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.670
Eimi...

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.600
Look at this CAD I borrowed
from the Hunting Club!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.430
Who are these guys anyway?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.520
W-We don't know.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.500
It's okay. I was scared, too.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.540
Huh?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:53.380
My body just moved on its own
because you were in danger.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.050
Hey, I was scared, too!

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:57.880
I mean, they were armed,

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:03.430
and even if this can't kill anyone,
I've never shot at anyone before.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.220
Eimi...

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.350
Shizuku...

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.940
Thanks!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:20.240
I don't have time to feel down.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.910
Next time, I have to...

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.950
Don't move!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.670
Arrest all of the coalition members!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.340
They're obviously working
with an external force!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.710
The explosion was set off
in the Practical Skills Wing.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.590
Let's hurry over.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.050
Right!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:47.140
Miyuki! Tatsuya!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.770
You three! What's this?

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.150
That's what we want to know.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:54.230
Who the heck are these people?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.620
Miyuki, calm down.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.870
But...

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.670
It's dangerous here for the three of you.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:16.420
You should follow the Student Council's
guidance and evacuate right away.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.880
You didn't answer our question.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:23.680
Who are these people?
What exactly is happening here?

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:29.890
I'm pretty sure they're with the international
anti-magic political organization, Blanche.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.230
The coalition members
are working with them, too.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:35.400
As was the guy who assaulted me.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.940
I knew what you three were up to.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.860
Sorry I exposed you to danger.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:45.200
Then, everything that's been happening...

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.630
They did this just to force
their own agenda through?

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.300
It makes zero sense!

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.720
Trying to make their case this way
isn't going to change anything!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.760
This is just totally wrong!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.140
It would've been conveyed just fine.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:11.680
That precious something that can't be
measured by grades or talent level.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:15.400
We're all First High students here, after all!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.980
So, why would they do this?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:35.000
I'm sure that if Ms. Saegusa heard
what you just said, she'd be thrilled!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.000
Huh?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.420
You can leave the rest to us.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.760
Miyuki...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.850
You and I sure are lucky.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.440
We have friends who aren't bound by values

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.520
and upperclassmen we can respect.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.570
Neither can be had just because you seek them.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.740
Yes, I agree.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:06.780
I'm truly glad
I was able to enroll at this school!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:10.950
You think Ms. Mibu and others like her
didn't have what we have?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.460
Surely, some of them do.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:18.170
Both Ms. Mibu and the coalition members.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:22.800
Like Honoka said, the important things
get conveyed just fine.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.130
If only they would realize that...

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:33.890
I hope they realize they're not being hurt
by discrimination from outside.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.020
No pushing!

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.810
Follow the Disciplinary Committee's guidance!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.570
So, Morisaki's on the Disciplinary Committee?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:44.360
Too bad he doesn't always act like that.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.990
Not that I don't agree,
but that's not happening.

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.610
Hey!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.330
Kinoe Tsukasa!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.410
He's making a run for it!
Let's go after him!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.500
Sure, but first things first.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:58.750
Huh?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:09.430
Mr. Tsukasa!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.390
What, you're leaving already?

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:15.100
With all those shady-looking people?

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.060
My eyes!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.910
This school...

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.160
No, this world is rotten to the core!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.540
A world where people
are ranked based on magic...

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.630
We the members of Blanche
refuse to let it exist!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.630
Hey! Come back here!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.300
Mr. Tsukasa, please stop resisting
and come with us.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.930
The Disciplinary Committee?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:09:01.690
A student sent us a livestream of your actions
via Light Refraction Magic.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:07.480
We saw the whole thing including you trying
to flee with your homeboys, the terrorists.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.210
That video was a lifesaver! Thanks!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.580
All right!

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.550
We've apprehended
every member of the coalition.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.800
We've also repulsed
the remnants of the terrorists

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.510
who infiltrated the school grounds.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.930
Just as we thought,
the enemy was Blanche.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:38.100
But why would they
launch an assault of this scale?

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.310
This was all a diversion.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.600
Their true objective is...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.650
to steal the classified materials

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:47.270
stored in the Magic University.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:58.450
So, Mibu and Tsukasa
and the others were being used?

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.660
Pretty low of them!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:05.580
You weren't the ringleaders
behind today's incident.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.750
You were only being led on.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.170
If we can destroy the ringleaders,

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:13.840
perhaps you and your cohorts' actions
will be overlooked.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.590
Wait, that doesn't mean...

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.680
...that we're going to take on Blanche, right?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.560
That would be way too reckless.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.850
We'd be going up
against a political organization!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:23.230
Shiba...

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:25.850
Do we have any chance of winning?

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.060
Yes.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.440
Jumonji!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.610
This is no longer someone else's problem

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:35.860
because we're involved
in this incident now.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:40.200
If Miyuki's and my daily life
is being threatened,

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.700
I'll destroy that threat
with every fiber of my being.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.840
That's the Blanche hideout, huh?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.460
Now, Leo!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.260
Panzer!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.950
Panzer!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.330
You low-life students!

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:43.310
Look at you, coming at us low-life students
in droves and armed to the teeth...

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.520
How pathetic is that?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.730
There you go again, throwing shade.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.480
Don't be so blunt.
You might hurt their feelings.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.860
The leader of Blanche's Japanese branch,
Hajime Tsukasa...

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:02.330
All of your schemes have been exposed.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.950
Give it up now.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.800
Decomposition? Th-This is magic, too?

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:19.550
Why? Why isn't my Evil Eye working?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.010
Hypnosis like a bogus magic trick.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:26.230
Did you really think that such a thing
would work on my brother?

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:32.190
I'd be willing to bet that's the trick you used
to replace Ms. Mibu's memories.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.190
So, just as we suspected.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.530
Yes.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.360
The intensity of her biases toward
the Disciplinary Committee

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.950
and the Course 1 students...

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:42.490
This man, Hajime Tsukasa,
was behind all that.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.490
You vulgar rogue!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.080
Brother, please pursue him.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.250
I'll take care of these people.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.090
All right.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.400
You fools.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:18.030
As if I would ever overlook
any malevolence directed at my brother.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.530
Don't overdo it, okay?

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:23.570
This bunch isn't worth
you getting your hands soiled over.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:29.000
It is your battle that lies ahead, Brother.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.330
I won't let them touch you.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.170
You monster!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:44.390
I suppose you wouldn't understand how it feels
to have been given such devastating power

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:48.060
that you're feared as a monster.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.070
I'm fond of my daily life here.

00:13:57.070 --> 00:14:02.490
I have my brother, Honoka, Erika, the
others and such lovely friends as well as

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:06.740
upperclassmen like the Student Council
president whom I can look up to.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:11.370
I love this ordinary daily life
in which everyone can keep on smiling!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:19.090
My brother is fighting
to protect that daily life. And...

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:24.340
what my brother wants to protect...
I, too, wish to protect! That's why...

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:29.010
anyone who tries to destroy all that
will have to answer to me!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.430
You people are certainly unlucky.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.690
If only you hadn't raised
your hands against my brother,

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:39.270
you would've gotten off
with just a bit of pain.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.240
Wh-What's going on?

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.080
I-I'm frozen all over!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:51.950
Wh-What kind of magic is this?

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.550
I'd pray if I were you

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:07.010
to be spared at least your lives.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.980
Are you worried about Tatsuya?

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.060
What?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.310
Don't worry, they'll be fine.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.900
I'm not worried about my brother.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.030
It's something else.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.160
What am I going to do?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.870
All those people that I...

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.920
Brother!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.590
Are you all right?

00:15:39.590 --> 00:15:42.460
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.340
Um, Brother...

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.850
The thing is, I...

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:55.640
It's all right, Miyuki.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.860
But that's...

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.690
Brother, don't tell me...

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:09.280
You have absolutely nothing
to feel bad about.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:22.210
Those were the people
I froze with Niflheim.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:27.130
My brother must've used that magic.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.970
The spell that goes back
through the Eidos' history,

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:37.350
reverting one to the state
before damage was sustained.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.190
Regeneration.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:43.820
But in exchange, the anguish
suffered by the wounded ones

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:48.070
is all compressed
and transferred to my brother.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.360
I'm so sorry.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.700
Once again, I've caused you...

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.210
Miyuki?

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:00.620
Are you okay?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.710
Uh, yes!

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.070
Brother...

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.610
Miyuki?

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.400
Would it be okay if we stayed
like this for a bit?

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.910
It's fine. For as long as you need.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:38.080
Please forgive me, Brother,
for behaving like a child again.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:45.420
I have to become the one
to protect you one day. But...

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.050
until then, just for a little while...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.570
Welcome home, Brother!

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:14.700
Miyuki... What are you doing,
posing like that?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.700
Well, because today is a special day!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:33.380
Brother, we'd like to wish you
a happy birthday!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.340
Happy Birthday!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:49.570
I'm sorry to cause you so much worry.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:54.740
Don't worry about it, and please don't be
so eager to play detective from now on.

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:56.620
Okay!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.200
Hey, look!

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.330
It makes me so happy

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:02.750
Don't you think these are good shots?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:02.750
to get to see my brother
surrounded by all his friends.

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.040
Yeah, you're right, they are!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.750
I'm so glad we overcame their objections...

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.300
and enrolled in First High School!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:13.010
Oh hey! Have you heard about Saya?

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:14.430
Saya?

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.050
You know, Ms. Mibu...

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.970
Needless to say, she didn't
get penalized for that incident,

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.430
but afterwards...

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.930
With Mr. Kirihara?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:29.860
It looks like they both finally realized
who it was they wanted to be nearest to.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:42.410
Brother, I'm going to follow you
wherever you go, okay?

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.370
Huh?

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.880
Even if you were to race away
at the speed of light...

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:52.670
or pierce the skies
and climb all the way up to the stars,

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:56.050
I will never leave your side, Brother.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:20:01.890
I think it'd be more accurate to say
I'm the one who's going to get left behind.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:07.560
But right now, we need to keep our feet
on the ground rather than climb up to the skies.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.150
For the sake of this daily life
I share with you.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.570
I would do anything for you.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:21.030
I have only one desire.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:24.200
Miyuki, I want you to always be smiling.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.000
All right!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:31.290
I am so blessed to be your sister!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.510
If it's what you wish, Brother...

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:41.680
then I'll go on smiling forever by your side

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:48.060
because this peaceful daily life
is exactly what we envisioned for ourselves.

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.330
That's our Airi.

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:31.250
Éclair Airi... The fact that you're a member
of the distinguished Isshiki Family...

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:33.040
is no fluke.

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:39.840
F-First place! First year...

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:42.130
Toko Tsukushiin!

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:46.260
Well, what do you know, I win again!

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:53.100
You've got to be kidding!

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.900
She knows not just where the clay is,
but the fragments, too?

00:22:56.900 --> 00:23:01.070
Her awareness of space is off the charts!
I don't believe that girl!

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:03.150
Shiori Kanou!

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:09.160
For me, taking part in
the Nine Schools Competition is a given.

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:11.290
To stir up such a commotion...

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:14.000
Really, it's so shallow, it makes me sick.

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:17.670
It just means you're that talented.

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:19.340
All good!

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:24.090
There isn't a single student
here at Third High who can beat Airi.

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:27.180
Probably not at any other
magic high school, either.

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:30.310
As a member of the Isshiki Family,
that's a given.

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:36.810
Besides us, there are the boys...
Ichijo, the Crimson Prince and Cardinal Joji.

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.520
I don't see any factors
that would cause us to lose.

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:43.400
Who's going to defeat First High and
win this year's Nine Schools Competition?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:47.030
"NATIONAL MAGIC UNIVERSITY AFFILIATED
FIRST HIGH SCHOOL"

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:46.950
That'd be us. Third High!
